+  nto-qnx* | linux-gnu* | linux-ohos* | linux-android* | linux-dietlibc | linux-newlib* | \
   linux-musl* | linux-uclibc* | uclinux-uclibc* | uclinux-gnu* | kfreebsd*-gnu* | \
   knetbsd*-gnu* | netbsd*-gnu* | netbsd*-eabi* | \
   kopensolaris*-gnu* | cloudabi*-eabi* | \
